// A CLF with an echoing target: whatever the CLF drives on S1 comes straight back on S2, so the
// transport can be checked byte-for-byte. The transport adds no framing, so bytes that a framed
// link would have to escape must survive unchanged too.
// The CLF has no register map, so it takes no sysbus address; it is still sysbus.swp to the monitor.

swp: SWP.SimpleSWPController @ sysbus
uicc: Mocks.EchoSWPDevice @ swp
